  "solution": "**Formula used**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² -ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation**\n\n((0.96×0.96×0.96+0.04×0.04×0.04))/((0.96×0.96-0.96×0.04+0.04×0.04))\n\nLet a = 0.96 and b = 004\n\nApplying the above formula:\n\n⇒ (a³ + b³)/((a2 -ab + b2) = a + b\n\n⇒ (0.963 + 0.043)/((0.962 - 096 × 0.04 + 0.042) = 0.96 + 0.04\n\n⇒ 1\n\n**The answer is 1.**\n\n3f:Tb",
